omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uW7aEGNPBgYQ7kNvwFshxff&_nc_oc=Adp3F4aI9VBMpTv18OZIhHR73O7achEIiEfkaFR-n5vk0T70EchaFl8PD2bI8rPxSTc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGX3znd5VQlUsWIW10UArXcnxktfFa8ozbxPSNKCF--EQ&oe=6A804BF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tTQdT3DiLjIQ7kNvwEEJ5hG&_nc_oc=AdoULMJiVzYngJFjnN2BUBP0LvldTxxwJDKMIUVkUWTYKSQpZuGn7ESwOrIO0jh_Dkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHRpL7AqrhV0-m4FHYW0z9ge0GbpoJg28F-p6zVPI6VEg&oe=6A804D56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KF3936M3NHMQ7kNvwEyzoqm&_nc_oc=AdrdBPv0OsYjlj9pCldhmE2OpzuUQUzKja7leM2Nqw5-cyslINK0VG5VovgatGZYy-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE06MDXboHJBTWrIuWRTudheIZfQ8a0wUwzC55pKR28Xg&oe=6A806277"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://